1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:03,500
There is a difference between relationships and communication.

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:08,220
Me with the cashier, the customer with…

3
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,260
The second, the third customer — fleeting encounters.

4
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:15,260
All of that is communication skill — enough to save the moment.

5
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:17,380
Relationships are deeper than that.

6
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:22,340
Deeper. And the other thing is that we also believe

7
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:26,560
our first confusion: that communication skills are the relationship.

8
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:32,340
Second: we think a relationship is just me and you.

9
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:35,580
Me and you is a relationship — but it isn't only me and you.

10
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:38,260
Me and you, me and you…

11
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,820
Only then does it become a relationship.

12
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,700
So it's the frequency of contact?

13
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:44,300
No — a fleeting contact; the abundance of interaction

14
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:47,380
moves it to another level, another level.

15
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,000
A simple example: right now I'm with the host in…
